# Sanity Studio: /studio/index.html is a real asset (copied by the prerender —
# Cloudflare Pages turns exact-path rewrites to /index.html into a 308 to /,
# verified on preview), so bare /studio and /studio/ are served natively.
# Deep studio paths rewrite to the studio shell; everything else falls through
# to 404.html (real HTTP 404 instead of the old /* soft-404).
/studio/* /studio/ 200

# Blog removed (Oct 2026). The 9 posts and the index were indexed by Google, so
# their URLs are redirected to the home page rather than left to 404 — that
# preserves any link equity and keeps visitors from a dead end.
/blog / 301
/blog/* / 301
/feed.xml / 301
